{"id":"48e0f1ed97a0b67b","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-promptly-nonrec.md","title":"Promptly simple 必非可计算","display":"thm-promptly-nonrec — Promptly simple 必非可计算","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-promptly-nonrec","aliases":["20-thm-promptly-nonrec"],"display":"thm-promptly-nonrec — Promptly simple 必非可计算","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"simple-properties 的直接推论","depends_on":["[[20-df-promptly-simple]]","[[20-thm-simple-properties]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-promptly-nonrec"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-promptly-nonrec</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-promptly-nonrec — Promptly simple 必非可计算"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"simple-properties 的直接推论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e84e0f0a140f460e\" href=\"?note=e84e0f0a140f460e\" title=\"20-df-promptly-simple\">20-df-promptly-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f045e001caa19927\" href=\"?note=f045e001caa19927\" title=\"20-thm-simple-properties\">20-thm-simple-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e84e0f0a140f460e\" href=\"?note=e84e0f0a140f460e\" title=\"20-df-promptly-simple\">20-df-promptly-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f045e001caa19927\" href=\"?note=f045e001caa19927\" title=\"20-thm-simple-properties\">20-thm-simple-properties</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}promptly\\text{-}nonrec}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathcal R,\\qquad\\deg_T(A)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}promptly\\text{-}nonrec}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathcal R,\\qquad\\deg_T(A)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>其定义包含 simple，故无需任何额外优先或 jump 理论就能推出不可计算。补元的免疫性已由简单性保证。</p>\n<p>来源：simple-properties 的直接推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-promptly-simple","status":"resolved","id":"e84e0f0a140f460e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-promptly-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-simple-properties","status":"resolved","id":"f045e001caa19927","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-simple-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-promptly-simple","status":"resolved","id":"e84e0f0a140f460e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-promptly-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-properties]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-simple-properties","status":"resolved","id":"f045e001caa19927","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-promptly-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-properties]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-promptly-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-properties]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}promptly\\text{-}nonrec}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathcal R,\\qquad\\deg_T(A)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1211,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e84e0f0a140f460e","f045e001caa19927","f389bdba28de0478"]}